{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sledding Game is a multiplayer snowsports hangout game with proximity chat. Go sledding, relax and see what else there is to do. There\u2019s also ragdoll physics so the crashes look <span class=\"bb_strike\">terrible</span> really really good.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/78925e1d8bfd9100a604b874c17dc2d1.poster.avif?t=1758902895\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/78925e1d8bfd9100a604b874c17dc2d1.webm?t=1758902895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/78925e1d8bfd9100a604b874c17dc2d1.mp4?t=1758902895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HANG OUT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use proximity voice chat to talk to your friends, or express your feelings by repeatedly crashing into each other.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/094d2bf1de00f1177b62fff741fc322d.poster.avif?t=1758902895\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/094d2bf1de00f1177b62fff741fc322d.webm?t=1758902895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/094d2bf1de00f1177b62fff741fc322d.mp4?t=1758902895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SLED FAST, SLED STUPID</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete to see who can reach the bottom first or get the most points through gnarly tricks, building your own ramps and launching off them. Or you can just sled around and explore, up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/b02c04b2df16f0d525a56c16c8fa96b0.poster.avif?t=1758902895\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/b02c04b2df16f0d525a56c16c8fa96b0.webm?t=1758902895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/b02c04b2df16f0d525a56c16c8fa96b0.mp4?t=1758902895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DO OTHER STUFF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break up the sledding with side activities and minigames, like snowball fights, snowmen making, darts, curling, roasting smores, drinking hot chocolate in the cozy cabin, and more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/20463f77927c0f63a7dac23cf3fac328.poster.avif?t=1758902895\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/20463f77927c0f63a7dac23cf3fac328.webm?t=1758902895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/20463f77927c0f63a7dac23cf3fac328.mp4?t=1758902895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOOKIN\u2019 GOOD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a range of fully customizable animal characters and expressions. Earn points to spend on cool cosmetics for your bod and your sled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/93993c0ed0ad03c31f758e89a9e8442e.poster.avif?t=1758902895\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/93993c0ed0ad03c31f758e89a9e8442e.webm?t=1758902895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/93993c0ed0ad03c31f758e89a9e8442e.mp4?t=1758902895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GET KICKED BY A YETI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a joke if you wander off course a yeti will literally come and kick you back on like a football</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/84910d8d83076595185b4b3f468933cd.poster.avif?t=1758902895\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/84910d8d83076595185b4b3f468933cd.webm?t=1758902895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/84910d8d83076595185b4b3f468933cd.mp4?t=1758902895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN THE SLEDDERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join public or private lobbies to sled with friends or meet new ones. Sit on a bench with a homie, or race down the hill with your group. With up to <i>50*</i> players, the ski-lift could get quite the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*I'm hoping I can do 50 player lobbies, but until further testing, this will just be a guess. Also I'm not sure if too many people will feel overcrowded, so I might want to keep it smaller</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect in the Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The demo of Sledding Game gives you a chill mini version of the full game to try: go sledding, crash in style, and hang out with friends (or random sledders) using proximity chat. You can race, build ramps, or relax with mini games like fishing, darts, curling, cornhole, and roasting marshmallows.  I\u2019ve also added plenty of customization options for the character (hats, scarves, goggles, sled trinkets, and buildables to mess with) and yes, the Yeti is here too. The lobbies are 20 player lobbies cause I'm working on some optimization stuff, but I think it's still a fun time (I had fun with just a couple friends so I'm sure 20 people is crazy, idk yet)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi I\u2019m Max! Sledding Game is my first ever video game! I\u2019ve been sharing my development progress online since the start so if you wanna see how sledding game is made or wanna share ideas, follow me on socials (the links are on the right side of the steam page).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Credits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: James Wrigley, Introverted Spacemen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logo Art:\u00a0Addy G Brown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fwog</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4029310?t=1758902895","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4029310?t=1758902895","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/742d3d39f87d0fed454fa13feba9aa7bfe7d32e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758902895","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/742d3d39f87d0fed454fa13feba9aa7bfe7d32e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758902895","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sledding Game is a multiplayer snowsports hangout game with proximity chat. Go sledding, relax and see what else there is to do. There\u2019s also ragdoll physics so the crashes look <span class=\"bb_strike\">terrible</span> really really good.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/78925e1d8bfd9100a604b874c17dc2d1.poster.avif?t=1758902895\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/78925e1d8bfd9100a604b874c17dc2d1.webm?t=1758902895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/78925e1d8bfd9100a604b874c17dc2d1.mp4?t=1758902895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HANG OUT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use proximity voice chat to talk to your friends, or express your feelings by repeatedly crashing into each other.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029310/extras/094d2bf1de00f1177b62fff741fc322d.poster.avif?t=1758902895\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st